bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[color=#F3C044]1. No Sockets on Equipment (PoE 2):[/color]
All Support Gems are socketed inside Active Gems. Loot and equip gear instantly without breaking 6-links!

[color=#F3C044]2. Soft Attributes (Approach C):[/color]
All equipment only requires Character Level. Never locked out of gear due to missing Dex or Str.
• 10 Str: +5 Life, +2% Armour
• 10 Dex: +20 Accuracy, +2% Evasion
• 10 Int: +5 Mana, +2% Energy Shield

[color=#F3C044]3. Smart Tooltip (Fast 1.5s Comparison):[/color]
Delta display shows instantaneous EHP (▲/▼) and DPS (▲/▼) changes for rapid theorycrafting decisions."

